  "definition": "Zoloft is sertraline hydrochloride, the hydrochloride salt form of sertraline. It is a synthetic drug described as having antidepressant and anti-serotoninergic properties and appears to work by selectively blocking neuronal serotonin uptake, which increases serotonin levels in the central nervous system.",
